@baseUrl = http://localhost:5878

### Get all activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities

### Get activity by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/1

### Create a new activity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": null,
  "name": "Test Ride",
  "activityType": "GrvlRide",
  "activityDate": "2026-08-06",
  "startTime": "07:00:00",
  "durationSeconds": 3600,
  "distanceMeters": 20000,
  "elevationGainMeters": 150,
  "description": "Testing the create endpoint"
}

### Update an activity (replace {id} with a real id from a GET response)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": null,
  "name": "Updated Test Ride",
  "activityType": "GrvlRide",
  "activityDate": "2026-08-06",
  "startTime": "07:00:00",
  "durationSeconds": 4000,
  "distanceMeters": 22000,
  "elevationGainMeters": 175,
  "description": "Updated via PUT"
}

### Delete an activity (replace {id} with a real id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/5

### Get a nonexistent activity (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/activities/9999